# Lock input only.  This is not an installable lock.
# Generate a disposable, hash-checked requirements-cpu.lock from these inputs,
# then record its digest and every immutable source/model identity in the
# runtime-manifest.json file before running install.py install.
#
# Official starting constraints observed in Chatterbox 0.1.7 pyproject.toml:
#   Python >=3.10; Torch/Torchaudio 2.6.0 on Python 3.11;
#   Transformers 5.2.0; NumPy >=1.24,<2; Gradio 6.8.0;
#   Perth is currently declared as a mutable Git master dependency.
#
# Approved package indexes for this target:
#   https://pypi.org/simple
#   https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu

--index-url https://pypi.org/simple
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu

